x192.jpg?w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;fit=clip&amp;auto=format 3840w" src="https://cdn.sanity.io/images/rafvlnhi/production/fe95ad4ff3098b12ed4240300d71718e7eaa887b-192x192.jpg?w=3840&amp;q=75&amp;fit=clip&amp;auto=format"/></figure><div class="AuthorCard-module__YIBjZa__info"><div class="textStyles-module__8Pv_-a__bodyS AuthorCard-module__YIBjZa__name">Meghan McGowan</div><div class="textStyles-module__8Pv_-a__bodyXS AuthorCard-module__YIBjZa__role">Cloudsmith</div></div></a></div></div></div><div class="blogArticle-module__236iBG__sidebarWrapper"><aside class="blogArticle-module__236iBG__sidebar"><nav class="ArticleTableOfContents-module__zX-P6G__root" aria-labelledby="toc-heading"><div class="textStyles-module__8Pv_-a__eyebrow ArticleTableOfContents-module__zX-P6G__heading" id="toc-heading">In this article</div><div class="Container-module__QumDGq__root ArticleTableOfContents-module__zX-P6G__contentContainer" data-width="xl" data-justify="left"><ol class="ArticleTableOfContents-module__zX-P6G__list"><li class="ArticleTableOfContents-module__zX-P6G__item"><a href="#what-happened-139dcb2d4deb" class="ArticleTableOfContents-module__zX-P6G__link">What happened</a></li><li class="ArticleTableOfContents-module__zX-P6G__item"><a href="#how-to-check-whether-you-are-affected-88b9d216aa0c" class="ArticleTableOfContents-module__zX-P6G__link">How to check whether you are affected</a></li><li class="ArticleTableOfContents-module__zX-P6G__item"><a href="#why-ai-development-is-speeding-up-the-attack-lifecycle-3e39fd8e9052" class="ArticleTableOfContents-module__zX-P6G__link">Why AI development is speeding up the attack lifecycle </a></li><li class="ArticleTableOfContents-module__zX-P6G__item"><a href="#block-compromised-packages-automatically-with-cloudsmith-b4605ba89eb9" class="ArticleTableOfContents-module__zX-P6G__link">Block compromised packages automatically with Cloudsmith</a></li></ol></div></nav><a href="https://cloudsmith.com/resources/artifact-security-maturity-tool" target="_b